Depending on the procedure, this may be expressed via the correlation matrix $\symbf{\hat{\Sigma}}_\text{emp}$ estimated from $\symbf{X}$, or the correlation matrix $\symbf{\Sigma}_\text{theo}$ corresponding to $\symbf{\Omega}_\text{theo}$.
In the following, we describe confirmatory methods organized according to the type of network hypothesis they evaluate.
